  <item>
    <title>EP05. 漫长的季节过后，回来聊《漫长的季节》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6473535553a5e5ea144c0d2e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6473535553a5e5ea144c0d2e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 May 2023 13:12:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，由于更新的突然，今天好像也不是什么特别的日子，就先提前祝大家六一儿童节快乐吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这漫长的拖更期间，其实我们也录过一期，但由于大家不小心又被工作和生活绊住了脚步（扶额），追热点的倔强决心还是没能赢过热点流逝的速度，于是就直接到了这期。依然希望路过这里的你收听愉快~</span></p><span></span><p><span>顺便继续附上听友群二维码，有想给我们提的意见或者想说的感受的朋友，欢迎加入我们的听友群：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtiixPfVHazjEINVMYfqgQ0JfWPu.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">0:45</a> 我们开了一个听众群，全是i人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">2:51</a> 漫长的漫长的季节后遗症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">9:06</a> 漫长的命运最后喂一颗糖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> 漫长的东北“爹味”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 如果用女性视角，它该是《漫长的逃离》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> 丽茹的季节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a> 辛爽现在是袁袁世界上最羡慕的内容创作者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> 漫长的蒋奇明和范伟夸奖会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2161">36:01</a> 帼蕾的《银河护卫队》超多剧透</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 银护的动画片逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2681">44:41</a> 宇宙里的小飞船《萤火虫》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2933">48:53</a> 每当我挤地铁，都会理解灭霸多一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2984">49:44</a> 山楂念诗time</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3227">53:47</a> 看痛苦的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">57:06</a> 去痛苦的阿那亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3695">61:35</a> 讲15分钟开心的段子</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期推荐剧集：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《漫才的季节》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《银河护卫队》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《萤火虫》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loWFTaVh8pgliSgjg_FdT7bJF5Jv.m4a" length="64990230" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvYmpseXBIRVJraDh6bVZPcENWREdrM1RtSUQucG5n.png"/>
