  <item>
    <title>EP04.《黑暗荣耀》&amp;《中国奇谭》，开年热剧阅读理解</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e0e92251a4e4150adf64b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e0e92251a4e4150adf64b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Feb 2023 11:48:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，年后快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近我们购入了话筒，袁袁购入了播客指南，对恢复更新频率这件事充满信心。如果你有在听我们的节目，有想给我们提的意见或者想说的感受，加入我们的听友群：</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span>这期定主题的时候，想聊一些23年年初热播的新剧，聊完之后剪了很久，结果已经全员在狂飙了。趁《黑暗荣耀》第二季还没开播，先把这期抬上来。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">0:57</a> 《黑暗荣耀》很好看，但难说很喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 女性复仇剧，男主有必要存在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 关于校园霸凌的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 对有钱人越宽容，对穷人越苛刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 东亚式复仇——考个编制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 《小猪妖的夏天》童年熟悉的善有善报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">42:52</a> 《鹅鹅鹅》原著是个什么故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3185">53:05</a> 看《中国奇谭》的弹幕，发现中国人真的喜欢做题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a> 来自河南人的劝告，第4集的河南话没有必要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3455">57:35</a> 中原人不供神，供商人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> 不可超越的散文诗《龙猫》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">67:02</a> 山楂最近沉迷伍迪艾伦的自传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">75:00</a> 帼蕾很喜欢今年的红白歌会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4688">78:08</a> 袁袁在跟《始于极限》的编辑写信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4885">81:25</a> 猫猫友情出演</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..png!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期BGM:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>有吉弘行&amp;纯烈&amp;鸵鸟俱乐部 - 白い雲のように（像白云一样）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期推荐剧集：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《黑暗荣耀》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中国奇谭》ep1&amp;2</span></p><span></span><p><span>《龙猫》、《风之谷》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《猪猡之王》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期推荐书籍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>伍迪艾伦《毫无意义》</span></p><span></span><p><span>村上春树《1Q84》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期插画担当</span></strong><span>：袁袁</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr7hod2dbIAC0k2fKhmcGYVb0VHQ.m4a" length="81400233" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0aGJ5THFTbHlaZXZMQnpHOWEwY1Vjcm9VZVEucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP03.2022年终总结，我们要善待自己的数码宝贝</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b44349289d2739647d93b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b44349289d2739647d93b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Jan 2023 15:01:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好久不见～</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们终于又更新了，不一定有人在等待，但想着留下来当作一个音频记录也好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期原本是想聊聊年终总结，结果呈现出来也都是非常主观的感受。不过人果然是社会性动物，聊天的过程中，还是被朋友们治愈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不确定有多少人能听到，但希望听到这个播客的人，能感受到哪怕只有一丝的幸福。</span></p><span></span><p><span>聆听愉快，祝您晚安。</span></p><span></span><p><span>show note：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">4:35</a> &nbsp;2022年的前几个月毫无记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">7:16</a> 帼蕾的2022，很混乱又恨割裂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> &nbsp;山楂经历了一场很动荡的迁徙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 袁袁在过一种拽姐的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> 这么表达有点奇怪，但看到自我的时候，像看到了自己的数码宝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a> 当三个月全职脱口秀演员你能学到什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> 帼蕾也去讲了开放麦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 心理咨询师，要有两个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a> 差点忘了这是年末总结</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luORy6zDnnf5SjVOZ9r28qA2vr8n.m4a" length="67962393" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtSpGPvOKm5dldZ6XUq_FK-hEONf.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep02:成为女性主义者之前，我得先成为女儿人权主义者</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628f80d25cf4a5ad60ca0bf5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">628f80d25cf4a5ad60ca0bf5</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 May 2022 13:29:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本来我们要聊《青春变形记》，聊过两轮以后，我们决定聊聊母女关系。也行，正好赶上了《瞬息全宇宙》。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART 1 我们又一次反省过去了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a> 偷看日记的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 希望孩子做正经人的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 在自己家庭没有被偏爱过的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a> 不在身边，开始相处融洽的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a>不希望女儿变成董明珠的爸爸（爸，你有这个命吗）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3665">1:01:05</a> 我跟你越来越像了，妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4338">1:12:18</a> 看《你好李焕英》不会哭的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART 2 我们要开始直面生活了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4635">1:17:15</a> 一读塞林格就情绪波动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4935">1:22:15</a> 我能留存的春天，就这一瓶马醉木</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5215">1:26:55</a> 童年CP，嗑到如今</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5642">1:34:02</a> 从来没看过《甄嬛传》但每个梗都知道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5838">1:37:18</a> 大师说话都很偏激，普通人才滴水不漏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6155">1:42:35</a> 全世界都是原材料，你别把我拖进你的叙事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6713">1:51:53</a> 有没有可能，人类对宇宙来说，相当于蟑螂？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期推荐剧集：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《青春变形记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《俗女养成记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《好男好女》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>综艺：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《来吧！营业中》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>书籍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《九故事》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《弗兰妮与祖伊》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>专场：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>柳炳宰《黑色幽默》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>帼蕾、袁袁、山楂</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkNmy00oA5zu6oDuiri1jU25cx16.m4a" length="125659309" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0Ym1hQ2pocjhWeUFad3dkcmxpV0E2VW0yUl8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep01:生活就是放诸四海皆不准</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6225ffc69eb22e46ffe6c21c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6225ffc69eb22e46ffe6c21c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Mar 2022 12:51:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>三条广告牌有三位主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>山楂（一个自封的达菲家族驻虹口推广大使）🐻</span></p><span></span><p><span>帼蕾（一个全职熊猫）🐼</span></p><span></span><p><span>袁袁（一个写字的）✍️</span></p><span></span><p><span>三人都不算生活精彩的人，如果看上去还算丰富，那就是来自于一些正在看的，听的，碰巧遇上的东西。所以，与其说这个播客是在分享安利，不如说用这些正在看的，听的，碰巧遇上的东西作为标识，来梳理自己的生活。一旦生活梳理好了，我们也就知道自己是谁了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期，我们聊了情景喜剧、女性主义和看一半睡着了的《四海》</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期广告牌：</span></p><span></span><p><span>美剧《老爸老妈浪漫史》</span></p><span></span><p><span>英剧《笑料一火车》、《屋事生非》</span></p><span></span><p><span>血与冰淇淋三部曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>真人秀《粉雄救兵》第六季</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐剧《隐秘的角落》、《小说》</span></p><span></span><p><span>美剧《老友记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>日剧《空中情缘》</span></p><span></span><p><span>纪录片《Tinder诈骗王》：</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客《日谈公园Vol.429 六兽专访》</span></p><span></span><p><span>书/剧《我的天才女友》</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期黑名单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>美剧《寻爸记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影《四海》</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>And There She Was - (From How I Met Your Mother)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hey Beautiful - (From How I Met Your Mother)</span></p><span></span><p><span>What Would I Do Without You - Drew Holcomb And The Neighbors</span></p><span></span><p><span>Big Train OP</span></p><span></span><p><span>Don't Stop Me Now - Queen</span></p><span></span><p><span>Queer Eye OP</span></p><span></span><p><span>Copacabana - Barry Manilow</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ride On Time - 山下達郎</span></p><span></span><p><span>The End of The World - Skeeter Davis</span></p><span></span><p><span>Elena &amp; Lila (From My Brilliant Friend)</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Days Go By (From My Brilliant Friend)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lriwsuhyhPWTLUOt6iaBkWtX4QGK.m4a" length="136211569" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtSpGPvOKm5dldZ6XUq_FK-hEONf.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
